      "text": "Whether a bathroom addition needs a permit depends on the work involved and the governing city or county agency, but new or relocated plumbing, altered walls, electrical changes, ventilation, structural work, and expanded floor area commonly require review. Confirm requirements with the applicable building department before construction begins.",
